OL,3,GNEWSATV sergeant had 'risky' public sex
OL,4,Awith officer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police sergeant who appeared on TV
OL,7,Fshow Police Interceptors has been found
OL,8,Fguilty of gross misconduct after he had
OL,9,F"risky" public sex with a probationary
OL,10,Fofficer.
OL,12,FBen Sutcliffe also had sex with the
OL,13,Fjunior officer while stood down from
OL,14,Fnight shift as a dog handler for
OL,15,FCleveland Police, a disciplinary
OL,16,Fhearing heard.
OL,18,FThe temporary sergeant resigned from
OL,19,Fthe force in February and did not
OL,20,Fattend the hearing chaired by Chief
OL,21,FConstable Victoria Fuller.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
