OL,3,GNEWSATV sergeant had 'risky' public sex
OL,4,Awith officer
OL,5,
OL,6,FFuller said Sutcliffe made a written
OL,7,Fsubmission, accepting his conduct
OL,8,Famounted to misconduct but suggesting
OL,9,Fit fell short of gross misconduct.
OL,10,FAfter hearing evidence, she said if he
OL,11,Fwas still a serving officer he would
OL,12,Fhave been dismissed.
